  {
   "id": 1,
   "type": "text",
   "title": "1 Sharing  |  PROVEN",
   "transparent": false,
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "### 6 models on 1 GPU\n\n**Traditional:** 0 of 6 up when started at once by hand. 5 of 6 one at a time by script, none retried.\n\n**Kubernetes + NVIDIA:** 6 of 6 ready in about 7 min, 0 restarts, answers about 0.4 s. GPU busy 38% (one model) to 93% (six): the card is full, not more work done."
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "color": {
      "mode": "fixed",
      "fixedColor": "green"
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 4,
    "h": 11
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "type": "text",
   "title": "2 Failures  |  PROVEN",
   "transparent": false,
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "### 51 s training, 77 s serving\n\n**Traditional:** Stays dead until a person acts\n\n**Kubernetes + NVIDIA:** Killed pods come back with nobody involved. Training resumes from its last checkpoint."
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "color": {
      "mode": "fixed",
      "fixedColor": "green"
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 4,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 4,
    "h": 11
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "type": "text",
   "title": "3 Watching  |  PROVEN",
   "transparent": false,
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "### Live, every 1 s\n\n**Traditional:** Check a terminal\n\n**Kubernetes + NVIDIA:** GPU busy, memory, power, pod status and restarts. Up in 53 s. See the live strip below."
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "color": {
      "mode": "fixed",
      "fixedColor": "green"
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
