   "title": "4 Moving  |  BY DESIGN",
   "transparent": false,
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "### 0 changed lines\n\n**Traditional:** Rewrite for each cloud\n\n**Kubernetes + NVIDIA:** Kubernetes is a standard API. The same manifests ran on two different hosts."
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "color": {
