  {
   "id": 5,
   "type": "text",
   "title": "5 Setting up  |  PROVEN",
   "transparent": false,
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "### 2 hosts, 0 changed lines\n\n**Traditional:** By hand on every machine\n\n**Kubernetes + NVIDIA:** Same Helm install and manifests on WSL2 and native Ubuntu. Operator found the GPU in 33 s."
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
