  {
   "id": 6,
   "type": "text",
   "title": "6 Growing  |  NOT TESTED",
   "transparent": false,
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "### Not measured\n\n**Traditional:** Rebuild a machine\n\n**Kubernetes + NVIDIA:** We had one node. Adding a node is the next step."
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "color": {
